codex
The classification is uniform but not superficial: all six are equations/macros that introduce names or recursive predicates, none matches execution state, and none has `simplification`. Stage 1 compiles all six before either `kprove` invocation, so there is no “proved first in a module without the rule” evidence for any reusable derived lemma.
